# HomiePG Owner App Environment Variables
# 
# 1. API Configuration:
# - For local LAN/Emulator development: EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://<YOUR_LOCAL_IP>:5005
# - For remote/tunnel development (ngrok/Cloudflare): EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-tunnel-url.ngrok-free.dev
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:5005

# 2. How to add new environment variables:
# - All environment variables accessed inside React Native source code (via process.env)
#   MUST be prefixed with 'EXPO_PUBLIC_' (e.g., EXPO_PUBLIC_ANOTHER_VAR=value).
# - After adding/modifying environment variables, restart the Expo Metro Server with cache clear:
#   npx expo start -c

# 3. Google Maps API Key:
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=

